<title>SINGAPORE: TABLE-Ace Dynamics 1H net at S$546,000.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Ace Dynamics 1H net at S$546,000.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended June 30, 1997</p>
<p>	   (in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		   0.55   vs   (0.91)</p>
<p>    Group share (cents)	0.67   vs   (1.22)</p>
<p>    Turnover		    20.11   vs   22.09</p>
<p>    Other income		 0.13   vs    0.09</p>
<p>    Operating profit	   0.65   vs   (0.43)</p>
<p>    Interest expense	  (0.05)  vs   (0.22)</p>
<p>    Depreciation		(0.28)  vs   (0.33)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	     0.32   vs   (0.98)</p>
<p>    Associates		   0.26   vs    0.20</p>
<p>    Tax			    0.04   vs    0.12</p>
<p>Note - Ace Dynamics Ltd, formerly known as Cuaseway Investment Ltd, said the profit was achieved on the back of continuing sales growth of industrial hardware division and gas units and the cost-cutting measures taken. It expected to continue to turn in profits in the second half of the year.</p>
